From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2941/3799] soh: rename func_80B40E40 ->
 EnXc_NextAfterNocturneReverseHalt

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from the Nocturne halt into the nut throw
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 7ffa7132b..4cfc8a879 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -2053,7 +2053,8 @@ void EnXc_SetupReverseHaltInNocturneCS(EnXc* this) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B40E40(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40E40: the same guard from the Nocturne halt into the nut throw
+void EnXc_NextAfterNocturneReverseHalt(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_REVERSE_HALT, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_THROW_NUT);
 }
 
@@ -2232,7 +2233,7 @@ void EnXc_ReverseWalkInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ReverseHaltInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_HaltAndWaitToThrowNut(this, play);
-    func_80B40E40(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterNocturneReverseHalt(this);  // was func_80B40E40 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ThrowNutInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
